    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In line with the celebrations of Digital Learning Week across the Aga Khan University, Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED) organized an online \"Showcase of Digital Learning in Virtual Classrooms\". This showcase was well received by the educators, technology experts and students equally. The showcase was led by two MPhil students of AKU-IED; Sahar Damani and Munir Tharwani.",
